  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Economies and Sustainable Livelihoods for Empowerment in Yemen (RESOLVE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Economies and Sustainable Livelihoods for Empowerment in Yemen aims to strengthen the resilience and economic empowerment of vulnerable communities in the Marib and Hadramout (Valley) governorates by supporting the creation, growth, and long-term sustainability of agribusinesses and agricultural value chains. In response to Yemen&#x2019;s protracted conflict, economic collapse, and severe food insecurity, the project shifts from short-term humanitarian assistance toward integrated, resilience</narrative>
  </description>
